WEBVTT

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:02.491
And the electricity generated
will be distributed locally.

00:11:03.283 --> 00:11:05.994
A very circular model,

00:11:05.994 --> 00:11:08.455
for climate and people,

00:11:08.497 --> 00:11:09.748
now.

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:11.291
Thank you for your attention.